  </button></template><md-icon aria-hidden="true"><template shadowrootmode="open"><!----><slot></slot></template>keyboard_arrow_down</md-icon></md-icon-button><h2>3. Recherche en Largeur (BFS - Breadth-First Search)</h2></div>
<p>BFS explore l'arbre de recherche <strong>niveau par niveau</strong><span><span class="md-ignore"> : tous les noeuds de profondeur </span><span class="md-math" style=""></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-6-Frame" tabindex="0" style=""><nobr><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-18" style="width: 0.669em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.515em; height: 0px; font-size: 122%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.386em, 1000.51em, 2.41em, -999.997em); top: -2.252em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-19"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-20" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">d<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.003em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.257em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.059em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.003em;"></span></span></nobr></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-6">d</script><span class="md-ignore"> sont explores avant ceux de profondeur </span><span class="md-math" style=""></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-7-Frame" tabindex="0" style=""><nobr><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-21" style="width: 2.718em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.205em; height: 0px; font-size: 122%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.386em, 1002.15em, 2.513em, -999.997em); top: -2.252em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-22"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-23" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">d<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.003em;"></span></span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-24" style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.207em;">+</span><span class="mn" id="MathJax-Span-25" style="font-family: MathJax_Main; padding-left: 0.207em;">1</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.257em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.184em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.066em;"></span></span></nobr></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-7">d+1</script><span class="md-ignore">.</span></span></p>
<h3>Principe</h3>
<p>La frontiere est geree comme une <strong>file FIFO</strong> (First In, First Out) :</p>
<ul>
<li>Les noeuds sont ajoutes a la <strong>fin</strong> de la file</li>
<li>Le noeud a explorer est retire du <strong>debut</strong> de la file</li>
</ul>
<h3>Proprietes théoriques</h3>
