  </button></template><md-icon aria-hidden="true"><template shadowrootmode="open"><!----><slot></slot></template>keyboard_arrow_down</md-icon></md-icon-button><h2>4. Recherche en Profondeur (DFS - Depth-First Search)</h2></div>
<p>DFS explore l'arbre de recherche en allant <strong>le plus profondement possible</strong> avant de revenir en arriere (backtracking).</p>
<h3>Principe</h3>
<p>La frontiere est geree comme une <strong>pile LIFO</strong> (Last In, First Out) :</p>
<ul>
<li>Les noeuds sont ajoutes au <strong>sommet</strong> de la pile</li>
<li>Le noeud a explorer est retire du <strong>sommet</strong> de la pile</li>
</ul>
<h3>Proprietes théoriques</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Propriete</th>
<th>Valeur</th>
<th>Condition</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Completude</td>
<td>Non</td>
<td>Peut boucler dans les espaces infinis (Tree-Search)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Completude</td>
<td>Oui</td>
<td>Graph-Search dans les espaces finis</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Optimalite</td>
<td>Non</td>
<td>Peut trouver une solution sous-optimale</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Complexite temporelle</td>
<td><span><span class="md-math" style=""></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-11-Frame" tabindex="0" style=""><nobr><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-45" style="width: 2.804em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.258em; height: 0px; font-size: 122%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.077em, 1002.26em, 5.946em, -999.997em); top: -4.027em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-46"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.258em; height: 0px;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.077em, 1002.26em, 4.512em, -999.997em); top: -4.027em; left: 0em;"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-47" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">O</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-48" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">(</span><span class="msubsup" id="MathJax-Span-49"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 1.096em; height: 0px;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.145em, 1000.41em, 4.238em, -999.997em); top: -4.027em; left: 0em;"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-50" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">b</span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 4.033em;"></span></span><span style="position: absolute; top: -4.368em; left: 0.413em;"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-51" style="font-size: 70.7%; font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">m</span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 4.033em;"></span></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 4.033em;"></span></span><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.077em, 1000.28em, 4.512em, -999.997em); top: -2.592em; left: 0em;"><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-52" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">)</span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 4.033em;"></span></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 4.033em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -2.163em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 3.171em;"></span></span></nobr></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-11">O(b^m)</script></span></td>
<td><span><span class="md-math" style=""></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-12-Frame" tabindex="0" style=""><nobr><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-53" style="width: 1.096em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.891em; height: 0px; font-size: 122%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.643em, 1000.89em, 2.462em, -999.997em); top: -2.251em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-54"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-55" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">m</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.258em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.079em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 0.754em;"></span></span></nobr></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-12">m</script><span class="md-ignore"> = profondeur maximale</span></span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Complexite spatiale</td>
<td><span><span class="md-math" style=""></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-13-Frame" tabindex="0" style=""><nobr><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-56" style="width: 3.555em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.872em; height: 0px; font-size: 122%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.077em, 1002.74em, 4.512em, -999.997em); top: -4.027em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-57"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.872em; height: 0px;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(3.077em, 1002.74em, 4.512em, -999.997em); top: -4.027em; left: 0em;"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-58" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">O</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-59" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">(</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-60" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">b</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-61" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">m</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-62" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">)</span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 4.033em;"></span></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 4.033em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.413em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.421em;"></span></span></nobr></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-13">O(bm)</script></span></td>
<td>Seulement le chemin courant + freres</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table></span></div>
