      <!--?lit$560317306$-->Gemini
    </div><div class="cell-toolbar sticky"></div><div class="main-content"><div class="cell-contents"><div class="cell-mask"></div><span class="imported-info-area"></span><!----> <div class="toolbar-root"></div>
      <div class="editor-container horizontal">
        <div class="editor-root"></div>
        <div class="text-top-div">
          <div class="markdown"><span><div class="text-cell-section-header layout horizontal center"><md-icon-button class="header-section-toggle" title="Réduire 1&nbsp;cellule enfant sous Interpretation - IDDFS et l'overhead de re-exploration (appuyez sur &lt;Maj&gt; pour réduire aussi les sections dépendantes)" data-aria-label="Réduire 1&nbsp;cellule enfant sous Interpretation - IDDFS et l'overhead de re-exploration (appuyez sur &lt;Maj&gt; pour réduire aussi les sections dépendantes)" value=""><template shadowrootmode="open" shadowrootdelegatesfocus><!----><button id="button" class="icon-button  standard " aria-label="Réduire 1&nbsp;cellule enfant sous Interpretation - IDDFS et l'overhead de re-exploration (appuyez sur &lt;Maj&gt; pour réduire aussi les sections dépendantes)">
        <!--?lit$560317306$--><md-focus-ring part="focus-ring" for="button" aria-hidden="true"><template shadowrootmode="open"><!----></template></md-focus-ring>
        <!--?lit$560317306$--><md-ripple aria-hidden="true"><template shadowrootmode="open"><!----><div class="surface   "></div></template></md-ripple>
        <!--?lit$560317306$--><span class="icon"><slot></slot></span>
        <!--?lit$560317306$-->
        <!--?lit$560317306$--><span class="touch"></span>
  </button></template><md-icon aria-hidden="true"><template shadowrootmode="open"><!----><slot></slot></template>keyboard_arrow_down</md-icon></md-icon-button><h3>Interpretation - IDDFS et l'overhead de re-exploration</h3></div>
<p><strong>Sortie obtenue</strong> : IDDFS teste successivement les limites de profondeur 0, 1, 2, ... jusqu'a trouver une solution.</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>itération</th>
<th>Limite</th>
<th>Noeuds explores</th>
<th>résultat</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>0</td>
<td>Coupure (profondeur insuffisante)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td>1</td>
<td>quelques</td>
<td>Coupure</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>...</td>
<td>...</td>
<td>...</td>
<td>...</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>dernière</td>
<td><span><span class="md-math" style=""></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-31-Frame" tabindex="0" style=""><nobr><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-235" style="width: 0.686em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 0.55em; height: 0px; font-size: 122%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.37em, 1000.55em, 2.462em, -999.997em); top: -2.251em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-236"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-237" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">d<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.003em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.258em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.079em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.004em;"></span></span></nobr></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-31">d</script></span></td>
<td><span><span class="md-ignore">tous les niveaux </span><span class="md-math" style=""></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-32-Frame" tabindex="0" style=""><nobr><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-238" style="width: 1.916em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 1.574em; height: 0px; font-size: 122%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.37em, 1001.57em, 2.599em, -999.997em); top: -2.251em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-239"><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-240" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">≤</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-241" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic; padding-left: 0.277em;">d<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.003em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.258em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.246em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.171em;"></span></span></nobr></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-32">\leq d</script></span></td>
<td>Solution trouvee</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p><strong>Points cles</strong> :</p>
<ol>
<li>IDDFS trouve le <strong>même chemin</strong> que BFS (même profondeur minimale)</li>
<li>L'overhead de re-exploration est <strong>modeste</strong> : les niveaux superieurs contiennent peu de noeuds</li>
<li>La memoire utilisee est <strong>lineaire</strong><span><span class="md-ignore"> en </span><span class="md-math" style=""></span><span class="MathJax" id="MathJax-Element-33-Frame" tabindex="0" style=""><nobr><span class="math" id="MathJax-Span-242" style="width: 3.076em; display: inline-block;"><span style="display: inline-block; position: relative; width: 2.513em; height: 0px; font-size: 122%;"><span style="position: absolute; clip: rect(1.335em, 1002.41em, 2.666em, -999.997em); top: -2.252em; left: 0em;"><span class="mrow" id="MathJax-Span-243"><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-244" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">O</span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-245" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">(</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-246" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">b</span><span class="mi" id="MathJax-Span-247" style="font-family: MathJax_Math-italic;">d<span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; height: 1px; width: 0.003em;"></span></span><span class="mo" id="MathJax-Span-248" style="font-family: MathJax_Main;">)</span></span><span style="display: inline-block; width: 0px; height: 2.257em;"></span></span></span><span style="display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; vertical-align: -0.372em; border-left: 0px solid; width: 0px; height: 1.378em;"></span></span></nobr></span><script type="math/tex" id="MathJax-Element-33">O(bd)</script><span class="md-ignore">, pas exponentielle comme BFS</span></span></li>
<li>C'est l'algorithme recommande quand on ne connait pas la profondeur de la solution</li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>Recommandation AIMA</strong> : IDDFS est généralement la méthode de recherche non informee preferee quand l'espace de recherche est grand et la profondeur de la solution inconnue.</p>
</blockquote></span></div>
